## Solution

```java
import java.util.concurrent.*;

public class Memo {
  static final ConcurrentHashMap<Integer, Long> cache = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
  static long computes = 0;

  static long square(int n) {
    return cache.computeIfAbsent(n, k -> {
      computes++;
      return (long) k * k;
    });
  }

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    System.out.println(square(4));
    System.out.println(square(4));
    System.out.println(square(5));
    System.out.println("computed=" + computes);
  }
}

```

